    "CoiStatement": "Drs. Engelen and Deutz are sponsored by research projects from NIH (R01HL095903 and R01GM084447), Abbott Nutrition (unrelated to CF research) and by startup funding from Texas A&M University. Dr. Com is a pediatric pulmonologist and CF director, and is partially sponsored by research projects from the Arkansas Children\u2019s Hospital Research Institute and Arkansas Biosciences Institute. The authors have a pending patent application that describes the measurement of protein digestibility in humans.",
